#. clinicSites.infirmary.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:8
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.name"
msgid "Hakurei Gate Infirmary"
msgstr "博麗門保健室"

#. clinicSites.infirmary.short
#: src/data/clinic.js:9
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.short"
msgid "Main infirmary"
msgstr "本部保健室"

#. clinicSites.infirmary.location
#: src/data/clinic.js:10
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.location"
msgid "Main campus · old shrine office east of Hakurei Gate"
msgstr "本部・博麗門東側旧社務所"

#. clinicSites.infirmary.hours
#: src/data/clinic.js:11
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.hours"
msgid "07:40—21:30; the desk is not guaranteed occupied for twenty minutes after the noon bell"
msgstr "07:40—21:30・昼鐘後20分は受付在席を保証せず"

#. clinicSites.infirmary.scope
#: src/data/clinic.js:12
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.scope"
msgid ""
"Scrapes, mild magical feedback, flight-muscle strains, paper-talisman cuts, "
"class-related sleep loss, and symptoms still deciding whether they require "
"Eientei."
msgstr "擦過傷、軽度魔力逆流、飛行筋の捻挫、札の切創、授業由来の睡眠不足、永遠亭へ行くか未決の症状。"

#. clinicSites.infirmary.staff
#: src/data/clinic.js:13
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.infirmary.staff"
msgid ""
"Duty clinician, two moon-rabbit trainees, and Reimu when she comes to "
"collect the offering-box fee"
msgstr "当直校医、月兎実習生二名、時折お賽銭を回収しに来る霊夢"

#. clinicSites.eientei.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:19
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.name"
msgid "Eientei University Hospital"
msgstr "永遠亭附属校医院"

#. clinicSites.eientei.short
#: src/data/clinic.js:20
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.short"
msgid "Eientei Hospital"
msgstr "永遠亭校医院"

#. clinicSites.eientei.location
#: src/data/clinic.js:21
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.location"
msgid "Bamboo Forest · Eientei clinical wing and lunar pharmacy"
msgstr "迷いの竹林・永遠亭診療棟／月薬調剤室"

#. clinicSites.eientei.hours
#: src/data/clinic.js:22
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.hours"
msgid "Always open; full-moon traffic diverts through the pharmacy corridor"
msgstr "終日・満月前後は調剤室迂回廊を使用"

#. clinicSites.eientei.scope
#: src/data/clinic.js:23
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.scope"
msgid ""
"Cross-species care, lunar sensory conditions, boundary sickness, phantom "
"desynchrony, fairy-core trouble, magical-material exposure, and cases marked "
"with three exclamation points by the infirmary."
msgstr "種族横断外来、月相感覚、境界酔い、幽体不同期、妖精核異常、魔法素材曝露、本部保健室が感嘆符を三つ付けた症例。"

#. clinicSites.eientei.staff
#: src/data/clinic.js:24
msgctxt "text:clinicSites.eientei.staff"
msgid ""
"Eirin Yagokoro consulting, Reisen triaging, and Tewi hiding queue tokens "
"back where they came from"
msgstr "八意永琳が診察、鈴仙がトリアージ、てゐが番号札を元の場所へ隠す"

#. clinicComplaints.danmaku-impact.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:36
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.danmaku-impact.name"
msgid "Danmaku impact / talisman abrasion"
msgstr "弾幕衝突・札力擦過傷"

#. clinicComplaints.danmaku-impact.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:37
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.danmaku-impact.prompt"
msgid ""
"Is the impact site still glowing, smoking, or insisting it was merely a "
"background bullet?"
msgstr "被弾部が発光・発煙、または背景弾だったと主張していますか。"

#. clinicComplaints.magic-feedback.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:46
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.magic-feedback.name"
msgid "Magical feedback / hakkero overheating"
msgstr "魔力逆流・八卦炉過熱"

#. clinicComplaints.magic-feedback.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:47
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.magic-feedback.prompt"
msgid "Sleeves, hair, or thesis appendices continue discharging after the spell stops."
msgstr "術式停止後も袖・髪・論文付録が放電する。"

#. clinicComplaints.boundary-vertigo.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:56
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.boundary-vertigo.name"
msgid "Boundary vertigo / door arriving first"
msgstr "境界酔い・扉が本人より先に到着"

#. clinicComplaints.boundary-vertigo.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:57
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.boundary-vertigo.prompt"
msgid ""
"The two sides of one door show different dates, or descending returns you to "
"before you climbed."
msgstr "同じ扉の両側が別の日付、または階段を下りて上る前へ戻る。"

#. clinicComplaints.lunar-overload.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:66
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.lunar-overload.name"
msgid "Lunar overload / wavelength desynchrony"
msgstr "月相過負荷・波長不同期"

#. clinicComplaints.lunar-overload.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:67
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.lunar-overload.prompt"
msgid ""
"Moonlight is too loud, colours are arguing, or rabbit ears receive "
"broadcasts from the wrong week."
msgstr "月光が大きすぎる、色が口論する、兎耳が今週でない放送を受信する。"

#. clinicComplaints.mushroom-exposure.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:76
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.mushroom-exposure.name"
msgid "Unknown-mushroom exposure"
msgstr "出所不明茸への曝露"

#. clinicComplaints.mushroom-exposure.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:77
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.mushroom-exposure.prompt"
msgid ""
"The batch is labelled “that basket from the forest,” and each sneeze "
"produces a different element."
msgstr "材料ロットが「森のあの籠」で、くしゃみごとに元素が変わる。"

#. clinicComplaints.flight-strain.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:86
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.flight-strain.name"
msgid "Wing / broom-launch strain"
msgstr "翼・箒離陸筋の捻挫"

#. clinicComplaints.flight-strain.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:87
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.flight-strain.prompt"
msgid "Turning remains possible, but Aya has already printed the landing posture as an extra."
msgstr "旋回は可能だが、着地姿勢を文が号外にした。"

#. clinicComplaints.phantom-desync.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:96
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.phantom-desync.name"
msgid "Phantom desynchrony / duplicate half-phantom check-in"
msgstr "幽体不同期・半霊の重複受付"

#. clinicComplaints.phantom-desync.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:97
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.phantom-desync.prompt"
msgid "The body says it has arrived while the half-phantom token remains en route."
msgstr "本体は到着済みだが、半霊の番号札はまだ移動中。"

#. clinicComplaints.fairy-core-flicker.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:106
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.fairy-core-flicker.name"
msgid "Fairy-core flicker / local season pause"
msgstr "妖精核の点滅・局所季節停止"

#. clinicComplaints.fairy-core-flicker.prompt
#: src/data/clinic.js:107
msgctxt "text:clinicComplaints.fairy-core-flicker.prompt"
msgid "Nearby flowers cannot decide the season, and wing transparency is not intentional."
msgstr "周囲の花が季節を決められず、羽の透明度も本人の演出ではない。"

#. clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:118
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.name"
msgid "Hakurei Stop-Sign Patch"
msgstr "博麗式止符貼"

#. clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:119
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.maker"
msgid "Supplied by Hakurei Shrine; hand-cut beside the offering box"
msgstr "博麗神社供給・賽銭箱横で手切り"

#. clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:120
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.indication"
msgid "Glowing abrasions, mild talisman residue, and small seasonal leaks around a fairy core."
msgstr "発光する擦過傷、軽度札力残留、妖精核周辺の小範囲季節漏出。"

#. clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:121
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.directions"
msgid ""
"Apply until the glow admits it has been noticed; inspect once per bell and "
"remove after three."
msgstr "光が認識されたと認めるまで貼付。校鐘ごとに確認し三回後に除去。"

#. clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:122
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.hakurei-seal-patch.caution"
msgid "“Great Fortune” is not a potency grade; Reimu does not refund blurred ink."
msgstr "札の「大吉」は効力等級ではない。霊夢は墨滲みの返金を拒否。"

#. clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:130
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.name"
msgid "Yagokoro Magical Diversion Powder"
msgstr "八意式魔力分流散"

#. clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:131
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.maker"
msgid "Eientei Lunar Pharmacy · Eirin reviewed"
msgstr "永遠亭月薬調剤室・永琳確認"

#. clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:132
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.indication"
msgid "Magic returning through hair, sleeves, or equipment grounding after a spell ends."
msgstr "術式停止後も髪・袖・機器接地線へ戻る魔力。"

#. clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:133
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.directions"
msgid ""
"One non-conductive bamboo spoon with unenchanted warm water; do not restart "
"the same spell for four class breaks."
msgstr "非導魔竹匙一杯を無呪湯で。四休時間は同術式を再起動しない。"

#. clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:134
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.magic-diversion-powder.caution"
msgid "Carrying it beside a hakkero treats the medicine bag before it treats you."
msgstr "八卦炉と同じ袋に入れると薬袋が先に治り、本人は後回し。"

#. clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:142
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.name"
msgid "Seven-Day Residual-Heat Ampoule"
msgstr "七曜余熱冷却アンプル"

#. clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:143
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.maker"
msgid ""
"Jointly prepared by Seven-Day Laboratory and the hospital; stoppers "
"inventoried by Koakuma"
msgstr "七曜実験塔・校医院共同調製・栓は小悪魔が棚卸"

#. clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:144
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.indication"
msgid ""
"Residual elemental heat, local fire/water/wood cycling after mushroom "
"sneezes, and self-igniting appendices."
msgstr "元素混合の余熱、茸くしゃみの局所火水木交替、論文付録の自然発火。"

#. clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:145
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.directions"
msgid ""
"Snap one open a lecture-sheet away from the heat source; do not drink the "
"blue Tuesday vial."
msgstr "熱源から講義一枚分離れて折る。青い火曜日瓶は直接飲まない。"

#. clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:146
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.seven-day-cooling-ampoule.caution"
msgid "If the bottle shows an eighth day, return it to Patchouli without adding a date."
msgstr "瓶に第八曜日が出たら日付を書き足さずパチュリーへ返却。"

#. clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:154
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.name"
msgid "Boundary Motion-Anchor Slip"
msgstr "境界酔い定位紙"

#. clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:155
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.maker"
msgid "Eientei clinical wing; Hieda Hall supplies yesterday and today editions"
msgstr "永遠亭診療棟・稗田館が昨日版／今日版を提供"

#. clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:156
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.indication"
msgid "Short-range anchoring when doors, stairs, dates, or the patient arrive out of order."
msgstr "扉・階段・日付・本人の前後順が不安定な際の短距離定位。"

#. clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:157
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.directions"
msgid ""
"Write today’s date and toe direction on a floor known to exist; carry "
"through five corners."
msgstr "確実に存在する床の上で、今日の日付とつま先の向きを記し、五つ目の曲がり角まで携帯する。"

#. clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:158
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.boundary-motion-slip.caution"
msgid ""
"Yukari’s signature proves only that she saw the slip, not that the location "
"is more reliable."
msgstr "紫の署名は位置の信頼性でなく、彼女が見たことだけを証明。"

#. clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:166
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.name"
msgid "Bamboo-Dew Return Tea"
msgstr "竹露反迷湯"

#. clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:167
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.maker"
msgid "Second kettle behind the east-gate rabbit-shuttle shelter"
msgstr "迷いの竹林東口兎車小屋裏・二番目の薬缶"

#. clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:168
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.indication"
msgid ""
"Passing one lantern three times, having your sense of direction outvoted by "
"bamboo, or finding the signpost more tired than you."
msgstr "同じ灯を三度通過、方向感を竹葉投票で否決、道標の方が疲れている時。"

#. clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:169
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.directions"
msgid ""
"Drink half a cup facing true east; if east is unknown, follow the medicine "
"scent and do not ask Tewi."
msgstr "真の東を向き半杯。不明なら薬香を辿り、てゐには聞かない。"

#. clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:170
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.bamboo-return-tea.caution"
msgid "The shortcut seen afterward may not be shorter, but usually reaches whoever needs you."
msgstr "飲後の近道は短いとは限らないが、通常あなたを必要とする所へ着く。"

#. clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:178
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.name"
msgid "Lunar-Dust Isolation Drops"
msgstr "月塵隔離点眼液"

#. clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:179
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.maker"
msgid "Lunar Pharmacy · fourth cold-store shelf (not the Hourai compartment)"
msgstr "月薬調剤室・冷蔵庫四段目（蓬莱薬の棚を除く）"

#. clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:180
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.indication"
msgid ""
"Moonlight that is too loud, star-point afterimages, and unapproved silver "
"lingering after full moon."
msgstr "月光が大きい、星の残像、満月後も未承認の銀色が見える。"

#. clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:181
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.directions"
msgid ""
"One drop at a time; close eyes until the next non-prime-numbered bell. Four "
"doses form one course."
msgstr "一回一滴、次の非素数校鐘まで閉眼。四回で一程。"

#. clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:182
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.moon-dust-eye-drops.caution"
msgid "A telescope is not a dropper; the astronomy club has received three written notices."
msgstr "望遠鏡を点眼器に代用不可。天文会へ三度通知済み。"

#. clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:190
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.name"
msgid "Reisen Wavelength Calibration Drop"
msgstr "鈴仙波長校正糖"

#. clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:191
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.maker"
msgid "Reisen formula; count before signing for any batch handled by Tewi"
msgstr "鈴仙処方・てゐ担当ロットは数えてから受領"

#. clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:192
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.indication"
msgid ""
"Colours interrupting one another, rabbit ears receiving the wrong week, or "
"gaze and trajectory disagreeing."
msgstr "色が互いに割り込む、兎耳が別週放送を受信、視線と弾道が不一致。"

#. clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:193
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.directions"
msgid ""
"Dissolve until sourness and red reach an agreement; pause wavelength danmaku "
"during three calibrations."
msgstr "酸味と赤が再合意するまで含む。三回校正中は波長系弾幕を休止。"

#. clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:194
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.reisen-calibration-drop.caution"
msgid ""
"May briefly reveal, with excessive honesty, the distance between a headline "
"and its article."
msgstr "一時的に新聞見出しと本文の距離が正直に見えすぎる場合がある。"

#. clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:202
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.name"
msgid "Mushroom Batch-Confession Syrup"
msgstr "菌傘ロット自白シロップ"

#. clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:203
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.maker"
msgid "Eientei Pharmacy; Marisa is still submitting the ingredient labels"
msgstr "永遠亭薬局・原料票は魔理沙が追提出中"

#. clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:204
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.indication"
msgid ""
"Elemental sneezes, hat-brim spore rain, and a newly added forest in memory "
"after unknown mushrooms."
msgstr "出所不明茸後の元素くしゃみ、帽子の胞子雨、記憶に増えた森。"

#. clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:205
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.directions"
msgid ""
"One bamboo segment per dose; state known material provenance first, or let "
"the pharmacist record “unknown.”"
msgstr "一回一竹節目盛。服用前に既知の由来を申告、不明なら薬師が「不明」と記載。"

#. clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:206
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.spore-truth-syrup.caution"
msgid "Does not compel truth; it merely makes the mushroom smell difficult to deny."
msgstr "本人に真実を言わせず、茸の匂いだけを否定しにくくする。"

#. clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:214
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.name"
msgid "Kappa Waterproof Joint Salve"
msgstr "河童防水関節膏"

#. clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:215
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.maker"
msgid "Kappa Joint Workshop medical line; the lid still uses tape as its final quality seal"
msgstr "河童共同工房医材線・蓋の最終封印は依然テープ"

#. clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:216
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.indication"
msgid ""
"Wing roots, broom-launch muscles, ordinary shoulders, and ordinary shoulders "
"strained while fixing equipment."
msgstr "翼根、箒離陸筋、普通の肩、機材修理ついでに捻った普通の肩。"

#. clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:217
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.directions"
msgid ""
"Apply thinly and wait for the tape smell to fade; check range of motion "
"around four practice sessions."
msgstr "薄く塗りテープ臭が消えるまで待つ。四回の練習前後に可動域確認。"

#. clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:218
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.kappa-joint-salve.caution"
msgid ""
"Works suspiciously well on mechanical joints; prosthetic users should ask "
"Nitori whether the jar is actually machine oil."
msgstr "機械関節への効果は疑わしいほど高い。義肢使用者は機油瓶でないか荷取に確認。"

#. clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:226
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.name"
msgid "Tengu Headwind Muscle Tape"
msgstr "天狗向かい風筋テープ"

#. clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:227
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.maker"
msgid "Youkai Mountain sports-medicine class; Aya turned the caution into a subheadline"
msgstr "妖怪山運動医学班・注意文を文が副見出しへ変更"

#. clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:228
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.indication"
msgid ""
"Wing-back and shoulder-girdle strain after sharp turns, diving interviews, "
"or emergency broom braking."
msgstr "急旋回、急降下取材、箒急停止後の翼背・肩帯捻挫。"

#. clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:229
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.directions"
msgid ""
"Apply three strips facing the headwind; same-day return is limited to low "
"straight flight, with no exclusive-story dives."
msgstr "向かい風方向へ三本。当日の復帰飛行は低空直線のみ、独占記事を理由に急降下不可。"

#. clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:230
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.tengu-tailwind-tape.caution"
msgid "Arranging it as an arrow does not void a flight ban; it only helps patrols find you."
msgstr "矢印形に貼っても飛行禁止は無効にならず、風紀委員が見つけやすくなる。"

#. clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:238
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.name"
msgid "Half-Phantom Positioning Thread"
msgstr "半霊定位銀糸"

#. clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:239
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.maker"
msgid "Eientei Cross-Species Clinic; Youmu supplied the post-use knot"
msgstr "永遠亭種族横断診療所・妖夢が使用後の結び方を提供"

#. clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:240
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.indication"
msgid ""
"Body and half-phantom queue number, arrival time, or mood appearing in "
"different columns."
msgstr "本体と半霊の呼出番号・到着時刻・感情が別欄になる。"

#. clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:241
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.directions"
msgid ""
"Tie one end to the clinic slip and let the half-phantom carry the other "
"voluntarily; compare both numbers after five doors."
msgstr "一端を診療券へ、他端を半霊が任意携帯。五扉後に双方の番号を再確認。"

#. clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:242
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.phantom-position-thread.caution"
msgid ""
"May not bind two assignments into one submission; the registrar has already "
"rejected the precedent."
msgstr "二つの課題を一提出に結ぶ用途は禁止。教務課が前例を返却済み。"

#. clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:250
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.name"
msgid "Fairy-Core Season-Return Leaf"
msgstr "妖精核返季葉"

#. clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.maker
#: src/data/clinic.js:251
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.maker"
msgid "Collected in the Four-Season Garden; each leaf is asked what season it believes it is"
msgstr "四季観察園採取・各葉へ現在の季節を確認"

#. clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.indication
#: src/data/clinic.js:252
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.indication"
msgid ""
"Fairy-core flicker, abnormal wing transparency, and nearby flowers refusing "
"to change season."
msgstr "妖精核点滅、羽透明度異常、周囲の花が季節交代を停止。"

#. clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.directions
#: src/data/clinic.js:253
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.directions"
msgid ""
"Place near the core without covering wing roots; replace across three "
"daylight periods with a leaf agreeing to the current season."
msgstr "核の近くへ置き翼根は覆わない。三日照帯ごとに当季へ同意する葉へ交換。"

#. clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.caution
#: src/data/clinic.js:254
msgctxt "text:clinicMedicines.fairy-core-warming-leaf.caution"
msgid ""
"Cirno’s requested “permanent winter” is not a recovery target; her objection "
"is on the reverse."
msgstr "チルノ希望の「永久冬季」は回復目標外。処方裏に異議提出済み。"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:262
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.name"
msgid "Danmaku Shoulder-Wing Return"
msgstr "弾幕肩翼リターンライン"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:263
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.lead"
msgid ""
"Breaks “I can still fly” into take-off, turning, stopping, and resisting a "
"breaking-news dive."
msgstr "「まだ飛べる」を離陸・旋回・停止・記事を追わないの四項へ分解。"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:264
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.clinician"
msgid "Youkai Mountain sports medicine / Reisen"
msgstr "妖怪山運動医学班／鈴仙"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:266
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.0"
msgid "Danmaku-free shoulder and wing range check"
msgstr "弾幕なし肩翼可動域測定"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:267
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.1"
msgid "Three low straight flights; no reporting dives"
msgstr "低空直線三回・急降下取材禁止"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:268
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.2"
msgid "Turns and landings with an explicit stop line"
msgstr "停止線付き旋回・着地"

#. clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:269
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.danmaku-shoulder.steps.3"
msgid "Return-to-flight slip signed by patient and observer"
msgstr "復帰票・本人と観察者が各一欄署名"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:275
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.name"
msgid "Five-Door Boundary Reorientation Walk"
msgstr "五扉境界再定位歩行"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:276
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.lead"
msgid ""
"Uses a traceable small route to recalibrate direction, date, and whether the "
"patient has arrived."
msgstr "追跡可能な小道で方向・日付・本人の到着を再校正。"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:277
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.clinician"
msgid "Eirin / duty recorder from Hieda Hall"
msgstr "永琳／稗田史学館当番記録員"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:279
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.0"
msgid "Record the date at Eientei Front Gate"
msgstr "永遠亭表門で日付を記録"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:280
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.1"
msgid "Follow three lanterns, not a fourth"
msgstr "三つの灯だけを追い四つ目は追わない"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:281
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.2"
msgid "Check toe direction at the pharmacy"
msgstr "調剤室でつま先方向を確認"

#. clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:282
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.boundary-walk.steps.3"
msgid "Return to the same door and verify it is still today"
msgstr "同じ扉へ戻り今日のままか確認"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:288
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.name"
msgid "Lunar Low-Stimulus Recovery Seat"
msgstr "月相低刺激回復席"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:289
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.lead"
msgid ""
"Does not dim the moon; it returns light, sound, wavelength, and headlines to "
"one channel at a time."
msgstr "月を暗くせず、光・音・波長・新聞見出しを一度に一チャンネルへ戻す。"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:290
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.clinician"
msgid "Reisen / Lunar Sensory Station"
msgstr "鈴仙／月相感覚研究所"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:292
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.0"
msgid "Twenty minutes in a no-extra-edition low-stimulus seat"
msgstr "号外なし低刺激席20分"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:293
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.1"
msgid "Identify three non-arguing colours after calibration"
msgstr "校正糖後に口論しない三色を識別"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:294
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.2"
msgid "Corridor trial under lunar-dust lenses"
msgstr "月塵隔離レンズ下で廊下試行"

#. clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:295
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.lunar-low-stimulus.steps.3"
msgid "Full-moon diversion and return-to-class note"
msgstr "満月迂回・復学メモ"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:301
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.name"
msgid "Two-Column Half-Phantom Synchronisation"
msgstr "半霊二欄同期療法"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:302
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.lead"
msgid ""
"Body and half-phantom keep separate columns without overwriting check-in, "
"arrival, or mood."
msgstr "本体と半霊は別欄を保ち、受付・到着・感情を上書きしない。"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:303
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.clinician"
msgid "Eirin / demonstration support from Youmu Konpaku"
msgstr "永琳／魂魄妖夢が実演協力"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:305
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.0"
msgid "Body and half-phantom take separate numbers"
msgstr "本体・半霊が別々に番号取得"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:306
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.1"
msgid "Pass three doors with unknotted silver thread"
msgstr "銀糸で三扉通過・結び目なし"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:307
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.2"
msgid "Exchange one observation without exchanging positions"
msgstr "位置を替えず観察一項を交換"

#. clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:308
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.phantom-sync.steps.3"
msgid "Arrive together and sign separately"
msgstr "同時到着・署名は別々"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:314
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.name"
msgid "Three-Daylight Fairy-Core Season Return"
msgstr "妖精核三日照返季"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:315
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.lead"
msgid ""
"Resynchronises the core with nearby nature without treating winter, ice, or "
"pranks as the only vital signs."
msgstr "核を周囲の自然へ再同期し、冬・氷・悪戯だけを生命徴候としない。"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:316
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.clinician"
msgid "Four-Season Garden / campus clinician"
msgstr "四季観察園／本部校医"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:318
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.0"
msgid "First daylight: check wing transparency"
msgstr "第一日照・羽透明度確認"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:319
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.1"
msgid "Second daylight: let three flowers choose their season"
msgstr "第二日照・三種の花が季節を選ぶ"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:320
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.2"
msgid "Third daylight: low-intensity prank test"
msgstr "第三日照・低強度悪戯試験"

#. clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:321
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.fairy-core-rest.steps.3"
msgid "Return surplus ice after core stabilisation"
msgstr "核安定後に余分な氷を返却"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:327
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.name"
msgid "Four-Break Magical Feedback Cooldown"
msgstr "魔力逆流冷却四休間"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.lead
#: src/data/clinic.js:328
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.lead"
msgid ""
"Until material provenance is complete, do not use a larger output to prove a "
"smaller accident has healed."
msgstr "材料由来が揃うまで、大出力で小事故の回復を証明しない。"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.clinician
#: src/data/clinic.js:329
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.clinician"
msgid "Eirin / Patchouli review / Marisa assigned to finish the labels"
msgstr "永琳／パチュリー確認／魔理沙は札追記"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.0
#: src/data/clinic.js:331
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.0"
msgid "Keep the same spell off for one class break"
msgstr "同術式を一休間停止"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.1
#: src/data/clinic.js:332
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.1"
msgid "List material batches and unknown provenance"
msgstr "材料ロット・不明由来を列記"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.2
#: src/data/clinic.js:333
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.2"
msgid "No-material idle calibration"
msgstr "材料なし空荷校正"

#. clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.3
#: src/data/clinic.js:334
msgctxt "text:clinicTherapies.magic-cooldown.steps.3"
msgid "Reproduce at quarter output and stop if unsuccessful"
msgstr "四分の一出力で再現・失敗時停止"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:344
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.name"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨魔理沙"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:345
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.reason"
msgid "Elemental sleeve sneezes; provenance still reads “found it”"
msgstr "袖から元素くしゃみ・材料由来は依然「拾った」"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:346
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-marisa.note"
msgid ""
"Eirin returned history version three and asked that mushrooms move from "
"“equipment” to “exposure.”"
msgstr "永琳が病歴第三版を返却、茸を「機器」から「曝露物」へ移すよう要求。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:353
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.name"
msgid "Cirno"
msgstr "チルノ"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:354
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.reason"
msgid "Chief complaint: “36°C is abnormally hot”"
msgstr "主訴「体温36度、熱すぎる」"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:355
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-cirno.note"
msgid ""
"The season-return leaf refused permanent winter; patient wrote “strongest” "
"on the reverse."
msgstr "返季葉が永久冬季処方を拒否。本人は裏面へ「最強」と記入。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:362
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.name"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:363
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.reason"
msgid "Wing-back strain after a reporting dive; interviewing the queue meanwhile"
msgstr "急降下取材後の翼背捻挫・待合患者も取材中"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:364
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-aya.note"
msgid "Reisen added the question mark because Aya published her diagnosis before examination."
msgstr "番号札の疑問符は鈴仙が追加。文が診断を先に掲載したため。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:371
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.name"
msgid "Youmu Konpaku & half-phantom"
msgstr "魂魄妖夢と半霊"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:372
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.reason"
msgid "Two tokens for one symptom; negotiating whether this counts as one and a half patients"
msgstr "同一症状で二枚発券・一人半の患者か協議中"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:373
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-youmu.note"
msgid "Youmu arrived on time; the half-phantom call record arrived four minutes early."
msgstr "妖夢は定刻、半霊の呼出記録は4分早い。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:380
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.name"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城にとり"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:381
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.reason"
msgid "Homemade diagnostic says “patient not found”; patient wants the device treated first"
msgstr "自作診断器が「患者なし」・患者は機器修理を先に要求"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:382
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-nitori.note"
msgid ""
"The device is held by three colours of kappa tape; pharmacy refuses to "
"classify it as bandaging."
msgstr "機器は三色河童テープ固定。薬師は包帯としての登録を拒否。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:389
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.name"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗霊夢"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:390
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.reason"
msgid "Restocking infirmary seal patches; insists this is not a visit"
msgstr "保健室の止符貼を補充・診察ではないと主張"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:391
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-reimu.note"
msgid ""
"The queue bell lists her anyway because the offering box occupies the "
"blood-pressure station."
msgstr "待合鐘は掲載継続。賽銭箱が血圧計の位置にあるため。"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.name
#: src/data/clinic.js:398
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.name"
msgid "Mystia Lorelei"
msgstr "ミスティア・ローレライ"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.reason
#: src/data/clinic.js:399
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.reason"
msgid "Lost voice after festival sets; answering on the menu chalkboard"
msgstr "学祭連唱後の失声・献立黒板で回答中"

#. clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.note
#: src/data/clinic.js:400
msgctxt "text:clinicQueuePatients.mq-mystia.note"
msgid ""
"Night-sparrow lozenges share a drawer with supper stock; Reisen divided it "
"with a red line."
msgstr "夜雀飴と夜食屋台が同じ引出し。鈴仙が赤線で左右に分割。"

#. clinicCategories.patch
#: src/data/clinic.js:406
msgctxt "text:clinicCategories.patch"
msgid "Patch / topical"
msgstr "札・外用"

#. clinicCategories.powder
#: src/data/clinic.js:407
msgctxt "text:clinicCategories.powder"
msgid "Powder"
msgstr "散剤"

